      "text": {
        "arText": "إِنَّا أَعْطَيْنَاكَ الْكَوْثَرَ",
        "enText": "Indeed, We have granted you, [O Muhammad], al-Kawthar.",
        "enTextTransliteration": "Innaa a'taina kal kauthar",
        "bnText": "নিশ্চয় আমি আপনাকে কাওসার দান করেছি।",
        "bntextLatin": "Niscaya ami apanake ka'osara dana karechi."
      },
